// HISVPN brand identity — the single place to adapt the build to a signing
// certificate or a developer account (App Store).
//
//   Certificate platform / super-sign profile: the values it assigned.
//   App Store developer account:               your own App ID and group.
//
// The bundle id, the extension's bundle id (prefix + ".HISVPNVPN") and the
// App Group identifier all derive from these two values everywhere —
// pbxproj, entitlements, Info.plists and the Swift code (read at runtime
// from the Info.plist).
BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX = app.carambola5307.spinach7929
APP_GROUP_ID = group.9e357262a457fc58.4
